[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5340.87, "timestamp": "01:29:00", "text": "つまり、通常は電源を入れるだけです。 電源が入るまで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5345.51, "timestamp": "01:29:05", "text": "30秒くらいかかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5347.59, "timestamp": "01:29:07", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5351.75, "timestamp": "01:29:11", "text": "そして、実際に抽出するまで10秒間のクールダウンが必要です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5354.79, "timestamp": "01:29:14", "text": "。 しかし、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5358.629, "timestamp": "01:29:18", "text": "抽出液に2"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5361.03, "timestamp": "01:29:21", "text": "分、おそらく"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5362.709, "timestamp": "01:29:22", "text": "2分以上浸さないと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5364.149, "timestamp": "01:29:24", "text": "おそらく"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5367.11, "timestamp": "01:29:27", "text": "自動的に停止します。 それが私の推測です。 私はそういう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5371.11, "timestamp": "01:29:31", "text": "状況にはあまり遭遇しません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5374.229, "timestamp": "01:29:34", "text": "あ、待てよ、生物研究関連のものがなくなってる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5376.39, "timestamp": "01:29:36", "text": "抽出拠点Xvilleは消滅した。 うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5377.99, "timestamp": "01:29:37", "text": "うん。 うん。 誰かが既にそれを取ってしまいました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5380.39, "timestamp": "01:29:40", "text": "。 さっき空に光が見えましたよね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5381.03, "timestamp": "01:29:41", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5383.11, "timestamp": "01:29:43", "text": "つまり、一人につき"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5386.55, "timestamp": "01:29:46", "text": "一度しか連れて行けないということだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5389.11, "timestamp": "01:29:49", "text": "うん。 もし彼らがそれを呼び出して"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5391.99, "timestamp": "01:29:51", "text": "抽出したら、それは消えてしまうでしょう。   ええと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5395.91, "timestamp": "01:29:55", "text": "恒久的なものはないんですね。"}]